  "body": "v1.13.2\r\nFix windows build issue from 1.13.2\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nv1.13.1\r\n\r\nReact build\r\nThe TUI no longer runs out of memory over long sessions: releases ran\r\nReact's development build, which records a timing entry on every\r\nscreen update and never frees it. The binary and both npm commands\r\n(epiq, epiq-mcp) now run the production build, which is also\r\nlighter and faster (XE850QF, https://github.com/ljtn/epiq/issues/470, https://github.com/ljtn/epiq/pull/471)"
